msgstr "Uppladdning: {progressStatus} %"

#: en.json:7551
msgctxt "app.containers.UploadWorldView.successDesc"
msgid ""
"Thank you for sharing your experience! Your initiative has been received and"
" is pending review. Once approved by the ARASAAC team, it will appear on the"
" map."
msgstr ""
"Tack för att du delar med dig av din erfarenhet! Ditt initiativ har tagits "
"emot och väntar på granskning. När ARASAAC-teamet har godkänt det visas det "
"på kartan."

#: en.json:7553
msgctxt "app.containers.UploadWorldView.successTitle"
msgid "Initiative submitted successfully!"
msgstr "Initiativet har skickats in!"

#: en.json:7559
msgctxt "app.containers.UploadWorldView.uploadWorldDesc"
msgid ""
"Share your project, center or initiative using ARASAAC pictograms. Once "
"submitted, it will be reviewed by the ARASAAC team before appearing on the "
"map."
msgstr ""
"Dela ditt projekt, centrum eller initiativ som använder ARASAAC:s piktogram."
" När det har skickats in granskar ARASAAC-teamet det innan det visas på "
"kartan."

